  function handoffReport(at){return`# New Store Handoff Report\n\nService Operations Dashboard version/build: ${VERSION} · ${BUILD_DATE}\nReset completed: ${at}\n\n- Store identity cleared\n- Advisor roster and participation cleared\n- Operational state cleared\n- Source and import state cleared\n- Operational history cleared\n- Internal backups removed from this copy\n- Imports, exports, and workbook revisions cleared\n- Report Inbox present and empty\n- 00 - OPEN DASHBOARD.html launcher validated\n- Diagnostics reinitialized\n- Support and recovery artifacts cleared\n- Product defaults restored\n- Application/runtime files validated\n- First-time Guided Setup ready\n- No known store-generated operational artifacts remain in the defined handoff scope\n`}
